  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to improve capacity to design and pilot greenhouse gas (GHG) Monitoring, Reporting and verification (MRV) systems in selected sectors to establish core technical components for the design of GHG emissions reduction crediting mechanisms in the Kingdom of Morocco.  &amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
